      "0": "Blade orbs are a simple but effective way to protect oneself from pickpockets. In case the fingers of a thief tangle with others baggage and of all that nice things get hold of a a blade orb, the mechanism of the small ball is activated and six razor sharp blades, coated with a strong neural poison, leap deep into the flesh of the scoundrel. The affected person is paralyzed for 10 rounds, the orb is destroyed in the process. The more blade orbs one carries in inventory, the likelier a pickpocket encounters them."
